{"id":"n66449-1-8","stage":4,"title":"안이하다 · 疏忽","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66449-1-8-1","ko":"겨울에는 너무 추우니까 그냥 운동을 쉴래.","zh":"冬天太冷了，我就先不运动了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"겨울에는","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겨울에는","audio":"/audio/5a9af46946ec50eb955e.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"추우니까","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추우니까","audio":"/audio/51c3e290177ec4552ffd.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"随便","explanation":"그냥：随便。","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"쉴래.","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉴래","audio":"/audio/412c7f8c0c81e6de4d07.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a688840abd7225911060.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66449-1-8-2","ko":"그렇게 안이하게 지내면 금방 살이 찔 거야.","zh":"这样贪图安逸，很快就会发胖的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"안이하게","meaning":"疏忽，轻视","explanation":"안이하다：疏忽，轻视；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"안이하다","audio":"/audio/5889f0960f3aa7fe740d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66449","senseId":"1","lemma":"안이하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안이하게","audio":"/audio/98c52d514030c32cb60c.mp3"}},{"text":"지내면","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내면","audio":"/audio/d88301bc38202e3d9770.mp3"}},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马。","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}},{"text":"살이","meaning":"肉","explanation":"살：肉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이","audio":"/audio/10d950f9fb857268bb30.mp3"}},{"text":"찔","meaning":"发胖，长膘","explanation":"찌다：发胖，长膘；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"찌다","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62375","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찔","audio":"/audio/1162cf26a412dca25e46.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"5889f0960f3aa7fe","term":"안이하다","zh":"疏忽，轻视","audio":"/audio/5889f0960f3aa7fe740d.mp3","entryId":"66449","definition":"对某事回避或认为容易而持坦然相处的态度。","pronunciation":["아니하다"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e